.TH std::ranges::concat_view::iterator 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::ranges::concat_view::iterator \- std::ranges::concat_view::iterator

.SH Synopsis
template< bool Const >                                       \fB(1)\fP (exposition only*)
class /*iterator*/
Helper concepts
template< bool Const, class... Rs >                          \fB(2)\fP (exposition only*)
concept /*concat-is-random-access*/ = /* see description */;
template< bool Const, class... Rs >                          \fB(3)\fP (exposition only*)
concept /*concat-is-bidirectional*/ = /* see description */;

1) ranges::concat_view<Views...>::iterator is the type of the iterators returned by
begin() and end() of ranges::concat_view<Views...>.
2) Let Fs be the pack that consists of all elements of Rs except the last element.
Equivalent to

template<bool Const, class... Rs>
concept  concat-is-random-access  = // exposition only
all-random-access ﻿<Const, Rs...> &&
(ranges::common_range<maybe-const ﻿<Const, Fs>> && ...);

.
3) Let Fs be the pack that consists of all elements of Rs except the last element.
Equivalent to

template<bool Const, class... Rs>
concept  concat-is-bidirectional  = // exposition only
all-bidirectional ﻿<Const, Rs...> &&
(ranges::common_range<maybe-const ﻿<Const, Fs>> && ...);

.

